    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>随着美伊备忘录签署，霍尔木兹海峡有望放开通行限制，对应油运市场可能迎来高景气周期，大纲如下：</span></p><p></p><p><em><span>一、当前宏观概况</span></em></p><p><strong><span>1. 美伊协议概况</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2. 海峡通行约定</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>3. 全球原油库存</span></strong></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><em><span>二、油运商业模式</span></em></p><p><strong><span>1. 海运基本概况</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2. 供给侧</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>3. 需求侧</span></strong></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><em><span>三、业绩驱动因素</span></em></p><p><strong><span>1. 运力刚性约束</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2. 战略安全需求</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>3. 黑油黑船转白</span></strong></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><em><span>四、风险因素提示</span></em></p><p><strong><span>1. 美伊和谈破裂</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2. 业绩不及预期</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>3. 宏观金融风险</span></strong></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgezvYNNU5_TkX1mB8leCweb4lvz.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbYEccq5D-LQ4ikwb7MmzOTfpF9.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj3BY2GWFnz2eQCQU_MCfubhbIuc.png"><p></p>]]></description>
