  <item>
    <title>13.泡泡玛特的多维度结构性分析，潮玩行业的竞争壁垒与远景展望</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699af545a22480add6b4f852</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699af545a22480add6b4f852</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Feb 2026 12:38:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>泡泡玛特并非一个均质化的整体，不同维度间存在结构性的差异。本期填坑（此坑完结），再借此探讨潮玩行业的竞争壁垒与远景展望，大纲如下：</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>一、近期关于泡泡玛特的交易简况</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>二、泡泡玛特的多维度结构性分析</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1. 对外沟通与投资者关系</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2. 产品定价、设计与艺术家</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3. 管理模式与管理层能力</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>4. IP热度与公司市值</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>5. 海外不同市场的差异性</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>6. 用户画像的结构性变化</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>7. 股权结构与员工激励</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>三、泡泡玛特2025年报的重要指标</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1. 国内和海外市场占比（全球化）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2. 存货周转天数</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3. 各IP占比及分区域市场情况</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>4. 衍生品及其他业务进展（集团化）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>四、潮玩门店草根调研体会分享</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>五、潮玩行业的竞争壁垒与远景展望</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1. 设计-运营-制造的优先级</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2. IP-品类的优先级</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3. 设计端趋势与AI赋能</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>4. 新兴IP和潮玩公司</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>5.关注边际变化及潜在投资机会</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft8cNRAip_-eDVasMfHTpSYD_ULb.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkGP6iRRjeZ0HIZyyPkoyczBt8Iw.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk840zWn3jK1KmV8xGI8Qnck5K0t.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhZHxkdtju9N3YKqysCWlRgbN5tW.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhqP5z60my6ijou0yaf9GvC6Owpc.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo2HkypdTfl4cU5VT_eb9EEuW0JR.png">