  <item>
    <title>12.2025投资回顾：如何开展定性研究，为什么最重要的是不要亏损</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696b8a76ef1cf272a7ea072d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696b8a76ef1cf272a7ea072d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Jan 2026 13:27:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>对2025年各个投资标的进行回顾，重点分享如何开展定性研究，以及投资不亏损的重要性，大纲如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>一、2025年度投资回顾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1. 账户全年收益概况</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2. 投资标的交易回顾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3. 重点公司简要介绍（腾讯、B站、台积电、谷歌、上海机场）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>二、以评标的方式开展定性研究</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1. 明确否决项并坚持原则</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2. 只评能力圈内的技术标</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3. 审慎看待低价竞标项目</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>三、个人投资者的市场生存策略</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1. 开拓自身视野</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2. “沉默的螺旋”理论简介</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3. 生物学对投资的启示</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu1oUJRDbTasekmnJB9uKfTdOGIO.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmcteFUsJubjd_i7fek1T9rrlJnC.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnA19LVj17KcvGixzfl9V8rF5X8m.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLOxC0Szh8MpnQzICI_XKNDkpjx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj02tcwZDD-dSpVGWoZ0R9vX30dN.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuCRtirulbApROgBf5gokN5BOuJ_.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuqNzFMvY2RAvkp7knaozKpwdiZ8.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoXKFasgvOe49uhrbFpeDeDan3PE.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv7gkRCA_n7t99CqNyBNrz4D5YlU.png"></figure>]]></description>
